--- META ---
name: trailers on a successful unary call
summary: output.trailers reaches the client as trailing metadata, independently of output.headers
tags: [trailers]

--- ENDPOINT ---
multiverse.v1.MultiverseService/Ping

--- REQUEST ---
{
  "message": "with_trailers",
  "user_id": "user_900"
}

--- RESPONSE ---
{
  "reply": "Pong",
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "user_id": "user_900"
}

--- ASSERTS ---
@trailer("x-audit") == "done"
@trailer("x-channel") == "trailer"
